(# ServiceNow MCP Bridge and MCPorter Runbook) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 788 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 774 Tm
(Version: 1.0) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 760 Tm
(Last Updated: 2026-11-06) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 746 Tm
(Audience: Engineers onboarding to the ServiceNow MCP bridge project) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 732 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 718 Tm
(## 1. Executive Summary) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 704 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 690 Tm
(This runbook explains why MCPorter was required in this project, how it was introduced, and how to operate the full solution in a production-like way.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 676 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 662 Tm
(The target user experience is:) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 648 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 634 Tm
(1. User writes a natural-language prompt.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 620 Tm
(2. System routes to the correct ServiceNow MCP tool.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 606 Tm
(3. System returns formatted results only.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 592 Tm
(4. User does not run low-level tool commands.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 578 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 564 Tm
(## 2. Why MCPorter Was Needed) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 550 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 536 Tm
(### 2.1 Original objective) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 522 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 508 Tm
(The project needed a local MCP bridge that:) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 494 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 480 Tm
(1. Runs as an MCP server over stdio.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 466 Tm
(2. Connects to ServiceNow MCP over HTTP.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 452 Tm
(3. Authenticates with OAuth client credentials.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 438 Tm
(4. Proxies `initialize`, `tools/list`, and `tools/call`.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 424 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 410 Tm
(### 2.2 Constraint encountered) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 396 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 382 Tm
(Direct VS Code MCP usage was blocked by enterprise policy in this environment. Even with local config, the editor integration could be unavailable due to org restrictions.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 368 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 354 Tm
(### 2.3 Why MCPorter solved it) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 340 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 326 Tm
(MCPorter provided a terminal-accessible MCP client path that allowed:) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 312 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 298 Tm
(1. Listing MCP tools.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 284 Tm
(2. Calling tools deterministically.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 270 Tm
(3. Testing connectivity/auth/proxy independent of editor policy.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 256 Tm
(4. Fast diagnosis of payload/timeout/response-shape issues.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 242 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 228 Tm
(In short, MCPorter became the practical test and operations harness while preserving the same bridge logic.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 214 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 200 Tm
(## 3. Solution Architecture) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 186 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 172 Tm
(## 3.1 Components) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 158 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 144 Tm
(1. Local Node.js bridge \(`dist/index.js`\) exposing stdio MCP server.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 130 Tm
(2. ServiceNow MCP HTTP endpoint.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 116 Tm
(3. OAuth token manager with refresh/retry.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 102 Tm
(4. Prompt router and orchestrator for natural-language requests.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 88 Tm
(5. Formatted result rendering for CLI output.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 74 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 60 Tm
(## 3.2 High-level flow) Tj
ET
endstream
