(## 8. Why Long Env Prefix Commands Appeared Earlier) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 284 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 270 Tm
(During troubleshooting, commands were run with inline `$env:` assignments for reliability across fresh shells.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 256 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 242 Tm
(Current best practice:) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 228 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 214 Tm
(1. Put all values in `.env`.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 200 Tm
(2. Prompt command auto-loads `.env`.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 186 Tm
(3. Run only short prompt commands.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 172 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 158 Tm
