(## 11. Performance and Reliability Features) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 480 Tm
() Tj
1 0 0 1 40 466 Tm
(1. OAuth token caching and refresh buffer.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 452 Tm
(2. Retry once on HTTP 401.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 438 Tm
(3. MCP response parsing for JSON/SSE/wrapped variants.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 424 Tm
