1 0 0 1 40 396 Tm
(   2. lookup TTL default: 60s) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 382 Tm
(   3. summary TTL default: 10m) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 368 Tm
(5. Slow summary warning threshold.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 354 Tm
(6. Summarization fallback to lookup when possible.) Tj
1 0 0 1 40 340 Tm
() Tj
